/-!
# Smoothings of complete intersections over a field

A complete intersection over a field `k` is deformed, over the formal power series ring `k⟦X⟧`,
into a family whose generic fibre is smooth, resp. étale, over the field of formal Laurent
series `k⸨X⸩`, and whose special fibre is the original algebra. This file re-exports the parts:
generic smoothness of the universal affine-linear deformation, the smoothing of a global
complete intersection, and the smoothing of a finite-dimensional local complete intersection.
-/
